Distribution and verification notes
-----------------------------------

installDist contains production modules and runtime SLF4J, not jqwik,
ArchUnit, JUnit, or JaCoCo. Legal files include the broader development
inventory for transparency; listing a component does not mean it is shipped.
No native libraries were found in the added jqwik API/engine or ArchUnit JARs.
The inspected module names are net.jqwik.api, net.jqwik.engine, and
com.tngtech.archunit (automatic); tests continue to run on the classpath.
